  <p id="c-songshu-046-zhangjian-complete:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangjian-complete:p001:m0000" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACA">敷</persName>弟<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangjian-complete:p001:m0002" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACB">柬</persName>，襲父封，位通直郎。<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangjian-complete:p001:m0013" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACB">柬</persName>有勇力，手格猛獸，元凶以為輔國將軍。孝武至新亭，<persName id="c-songshu-046-zhangjian-complete:p001:m0038" ref="d50_8f5_wul_AAACB">柬</persName>出奔，墜淮死。</p>
</text>
